---
const checklist = [
  {
    title: "Flight Delay Tracking Included",
    desc: "We continuously monitor your flight status so your driver arrives right when you touch down."
  },
  {
    title: "Licensed & Vetted Chauffeurs",
    desc: "English-speaking professional drivers experienced in Cairo traffic and airport logistics."
  },
  {
    title: "24/7 Customer Support Hotline & WhatsApp",
    desc: "Always accessible local Cairo dispatchers ready to assist you any time day or night."
  },
  {
    title: "Modern, Clean & Air-Conditioned Fleet",
    desc: "Late-model sedans, spacious minivans, and buses equipped with crisp climate control."
  },
  {
    title: "Zero Surcharges & No Hidden Tolls",
    desc: "Airport gate taxes, highway tolls, and parking tickets are 100% included in your quote."
  }
];
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-slate-200/60">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase">
          STRESS-FREE TRANSFERS & LIMOUSINE SERVICE
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Book & Reserve Official Cairo Airport Limousine & Transfers
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Planning your <strong>transfer from Cairo airport</strong> in advance is the smartest decision for international tourists, business executives, and visiting families. With our pre-booked <strong>Cairo international airport transfers</strong>, you eliminate the stress of crowded taxi stands, volatile currency exchange haggling, and unmetered cab fares.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          From the moment you step out of Terminal 1, Terminal 2, or Terminal 3, your private chauffeur takes care of every single detail. Whether you need a comfortable family shuttle or prefer to reserve an executive <strong>Cairo airport private limousine</strong>, you will be escorted to an immaculate, air-conditioned vehicle and driven safely via direct expressways straight to your hotel doorstep.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-emerald-600">✓</span> Child seats on request
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-emerald-600">✓</span> Luggage assistance & meet outside with sign
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg">
            <span class="text-emerald-600">✓</span> Cashless online booking
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Navy Checklist Box -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="bg-[#141238] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-2xl border border-indigo-900/60 relative overflow-hidden">
          
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center font-black">
              ★
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
                Everything you need to know
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Our promise for every airport transfer booking</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            {checklist.map((item, index) => (
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#1e1a4f]/70 border border-indigo-900/40">
                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">
                    {item.title}
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                    {item.desc}
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
